    m_Localized: Rock and Roll with the rough ridin' road hog.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 295548877537280
    m_Localized: Defy the laws of physics in this buggy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 295618981134336
    m_Localized: Supercharged super speed. Easy does it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298206963171328
    m_Localized: Sleek and powerful, this cat is ready to roar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298303369248768
    m_Localized: This beachcomber is at home on any stunt circuit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298403818635264
    m_Localized: Unleash the Brute for no-nonsense on the road!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298478489829376
    m_Localized: Fly fast and true with this stuntcar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298528146194432
    m_Localized: Powerful and fast, this streetwise 4x4 is incredible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298610115477504
    m_Localized: Super light and very fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 298667858460672
    m_Localized: Monkey see, monkey do! Go bananas with this wild ride!
