  - m_Id: 612559939698688
    m_Localized: GERMANY\n\nLoud crowd cheering and powerful spotlights..This german
      arena is really a place to show off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 612961032601600
    m_Localized: JAPAN\n\nHere in this calm japanese dojo placed on the outskirts
      of Kyoto you can meditate or organize a race!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 613466748223488
    m_Localized: 'SPAIN\n\nBeaches like this usually ooze holidays. This is not an
      exception: warm sand, palms, and sun.. What could people possibly want more?
      Maybe a RC car race :)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 614066437226496
    m_Localized: FRANCE\n\nThis shadowy warehouse is full of boxes, forklifts and
      machinery. There are some really dark places here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 614504834269184
    m_Localized: ENGLAND\n\nEnglish go-kart track is a good location to test your
      driving skills. This place has a reputation for great races.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 614920951169024
    m_Localized: USA\n\nAre you looking for an intense experience? Racing on top
      of a multistorey parking lot located in the heart of New York will be a bombastic
      idea!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 615367665516544
    m_Localized: 'ITALY\n\nFeeling mediterranean? This italian coast is very scenic,
      especially at night. There are two dangers here to look out however: staircase
      descent and water!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 616094777475072
    m_Localized: MEXICO\n\nOnly some people are in a possession of info that there's
      this ancient place located in the middle of an unknown mexican forest, where
      aztecs used to race RC-cars. However no-one really knows how to get there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 619262177443840
    m_Localized: GOOD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 619327709249536
    m_Localized: GREAT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
